# Standalone uv project artifacts.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Downloaded corpus + index cache live under data/ and are not committed. Provenance
# (dataset repo, revision, sha256) is pinned in eval.toml and verified by `run --verify`.
data/*

# Run outputs are gitignored EXCEPT the committed report directory.
out/*
!out/report/

# The failure taxonomy is an analysis deliverable, not a run output.
!out/failure-taxonomy.md

# The scored control set is the evidence behind the published FAR/FRR, and kappa.py joins the
# human labels against it — so it is committed, unlike the run outputs beside it. `-v1` is the
# ORIGINAL control set's run: judge-validation.md publishes its numbers beside the corrected ones,
# computed from these rows via `judge-validate --prior`, never retyped.
!out/judge-controls-scored.jsonl
!out/judge-controls-scored-v1.jsonl
